<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Welcome!</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 30px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      background-color: #FF5500;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .features {
      background-color: white;
      border-radius: 5px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>🎵 Welcome to Harmonica!</h1>
    
    <p>Hi {{username}},</p>
    
    <p>Welcome to our community! We're excited to have you on board.</p>
    
    <div class="features">
      <h3>Get Started:</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>🎧 Discover new music</li>
        <li>📤 Upload your tracks</li>
        <li>👥 Follow your favorite artists</li>
        <li>💬 Connect with other music lovers</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Start Exploring</a>
    </div>
    
    <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>
    
    <p>Happy listening!<br>The Harmonica Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>